; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; SIMK combo: artefact inside the SIMK container.
;
; belt = FALSE is the whole point: unlike every other combo, this one must NOT
; be wearable on the belt (CInventory::CanPutInBelt, Inventory.cpp:1295-1303
; checks the Belt flag, which comes from this key - inventory_item.cpp:170).
;
; radiation_restore_speed = 0 means "absorbs everything": the backpack mechanic
; ignores negative values, so zero contribution is exactly full absorption,
; whatever the artefact emits.
;
; Protection comes from the SIMK's own neutral table, not from the artefact:
; the artefact's protection is belt-only and this item can never reach the belt.
; Cell (3,1) in the atlas - the first row of filled combos, fourth column.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
